        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 17,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "I have called on you, for you will answer me, God. Turn your ear to me. Hear my speech.",
      "ko": "하나님이여 내게 응답하시겠는고로 내가 불렀사오니 귀를 기울여 내 말을 들으소서",
      "source_text_hash": "4b0f1c34bc0690d141bb465171dafef4db8e932ff764e192c7ffca2766a69cbc",
      "translation_text_hash": "4618ed759fabe84f8ec5a2b781675e6bfe3482ce220cc404861b6d439d47f05b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "하나님이여 내게 응답하시겠는고로 내가 불렀사오니 귀를 기울여 내 말을 들으소서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4618ed759fabe84f8ec5a2b781675e6bfe3482ce220cc404861b6d439d47f05b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:17:7",
      "sequence": 14111,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 17",
